      "content": "thanks, that's a good start. it's clear enough but maybe a bit too plain. \n\ncould we try another version that's a bit more detailed? specifically, i need it to mention how hypertension can lead to serious issues like heart attacks or strokes, so patients understand the risk. \n\njust a reminder though: the simplicity score (words with < 3 syllables) is still how we're ranking these drafts for the client. please make sure it's useful and medically sound—don't just sacrifice the quality of the explanation just to keep that score high. i'd rather have a slightly lower score with better info than a perfect score that says nothing.",
